        }

        fix: fn(self) -> String {
            "For an ordinary effect, add `{self.effect_name}` to `{self.dep}`'s line in `authority.grants` (or to `authority.allow` when it has no line), or keep a version that stays inside it; for deny-only `Panic`, return a fallible result or add facts/`#Pre`/refinement proof."
